 {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(u+v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2-3u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(1+u-v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,2,\\,3⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨3,\\,2,\\,3⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+4+9} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{22}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, let's denote\n\n$$\nD={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 2,\\,-1\\le v\\le 1}.\n$$\n\nThen, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{22}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{22}{∬}_{D}\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{22}\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{22}\\cdot 2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{22}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349835 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349836 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349837 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349838 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349839 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1041 "selection" 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1104 #edb/ref 17592186349836 13194139535451 true] [17592186349834 1110 #uuid "51171050-cc34-549b-bd54-7fa6031ebbb4" 13194139535451 true] [17592186349835 1034 "8\\sqrt{11}" 13194139535451 true] [17592186349835 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535451 true] [17592186349835 1111 #uuid "28097084-cd2f-5d11-a905-838c51b4f38a" 13194139535451 true] [1759